00:09:03.192 --> 00:09:07.224
<v Host>Time for a short quiz. Listen and try to answer.

00:09:07.823 --> 00:09:16.751
<v Slow>10月1日から、ビールの税金は高くなりますか、安くなりますか。

00:09:17.552 --> 00:09:21.248
<v Host>It goes down — beer gets a tax cut of about nine yen.

00:09:21.847 --> 00:09:28.207
