00:09:32.296 --> 00:09:40.024
<v Slow>350ミリリットルの缶の税金は、いくらになりますか。

00:09:40.823 --> 00:09:45.312
<v Host>Fifty-four point two five yen — the same for all three kinds.

00:09:45.912 --> 00:09:56.207
<v Host>That's all for today. Next month, check the price tags at the store — a new era of beer competition begins. See you next time. Bye!

00:09:56.807 --> 00:09:59.207
<v News>また明日。
